Likely questions, short answers
• "Is it always right?" No. It can make mistakes, especially with numbers. Treat it as a fast first draft and check before you send.
• "Can colleagues see my chats?" No, your chats aren't shared with colleagues. Like email, they still fall under the firm's normal compliance and record-keeping rules.
• "Can I use client data?" Follow the same rules you follow today. If unsure, ask [compliance contact].
• "I don't see the Work IQ button." Using your work data needs the paid Microsoft 365 Copilot licence. Check with IT.
• "Will this replace my job?" It replaces the boring parts of the job. The judgement is still yours.
